      "extract": "arXiv:0801.0083v4 [math.AG] 18 Feb 2010 CENTRAL EXTENSIONS OF GERBES AMNON YEKUTIELI Abstract. We introduce the notion of central extension of gerbes on a topo- logical space X. We show that there are obstruction classes to lifting objects and isomorphisms in a central extension. We also discuss pronilpotent gerbes. These results are used in the paper [Ye] to study twisted deformation quanti- zation on algebraic",
